# Copy to frontend/.env for local development. A deployed build gets
# VITE_PUBLIC_API_URL as a build variable (Coolify, or `--build-arg`).
#
# The browser calls its own origin: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:4006
# (vite.config.ts) and nginx does the same in production. Leave VITE_API_URL
# unset — setting it in a deploy brings cross-origin calls and CORS back.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4002

# The API origin shown to users and called by outside clients (MCP connectors,
# mobile). Required for a deployed build. Local dev falls back to
# http://localhost:4006.
# VITE_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.dirah.co.za
